    "title": "Clover: Perks and Order Ahead",
    "description": "Clover lets you earn loyalty rewards and perks at your favorite local businesses. Visit a participating spot, introduce yourself, and collect points to earn perks. Or skip the line and place mobile orders for pickup right from the app.\r\n\r\nHow it works:\r\n\r\nWe designed Clover to be fast, friendly, and out of the way. When you check into one of your favorite spots, Clover lets the merchant know that you're in the house. Just mention your first name when you make a purchase, and you'll be on your way to earning perks \u2014 no punch cards to remember to bring, scanning of codes, or fussing with gadgets at the counter.\r\n\r\nWe've recently added mobile ordering capabilities, so you can skip the line and pick up your order. Look for the \"Order Ahead\" tab or shopping bag icon at participating businesses.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Clover lets you earn loyalty rewards and perks at your favorite local businesses. Visit a participating spot, introduce yourself, and collect points to earn perks. Or skip the line and place mobile orders for pickup right from the app.<br><br>How it works:<br><br>We designed Clover to be fast, friendly, and out of the way. When you check into one of your favorite spots, Clover lets the merchant know that you&#39;re in the house. Just mention your first name when you make a purchase, and you&#39;ll be on your way to earning perks \u2014 no punch cards to remember to bring, scanning of codes, or fussing with gadgets at the counter.<br><br>We&#39;ve recently added mobile ordering capabilities, so you can skip the line and pick up your order. Look for the &quot;Order Ahead&quot; tab or shopping bag icon at participating businesses.",
